  "remaining": [
    "Automatic brightest-face reference and target body matching remain unimplemented. Manual face-only partial does not complete the official AI requirement.",
    "No tests/build/typecheck/native numerical/GUI/photographic/history/reopen/export/performance acceptance executed.",
    "Generic presets, batch, cohorts and shared-source alias activation remain fenced; no donor masks, fitted coefficients or relation metadata copied as portable parameters.",
    "Displayed source and full mixed review pages are reduced RGB8 PNGs, not native-resolution precision inspection. Full-source fit and final render remain independently bound; no complete preview/export pixel-parity claim.",
    "Opaque SDR original PNG16/ICC16/RAW16 and canonical derived float source contracts only; alpha/HDR refusal retained without silent clipping.",
    "Existing portrait face/memory caps apply. Fixed native fit/tile budgets are source contracts, not demonstrated 24MP capacity. Source capture can decode repeatedly and synchronous decoder/solver kernels lack a newly guaranteed UI cancellation path.",
    "Unknown mutation retains original-request query/fence. No dedicated verified workspace-retirement protocol; full application restart and last confirmed saved-project reopen may be needed, with possible loss of unsaved changes. Mere document reopen does not prove old write failed.",
    "Dedicated effect-recovery painting and automatic source-reference detection remain separate unfinished paths. Static module registration is not hot runtime plugin loading."
